          <real>198.1</real>
        </array>
        <key>joiningBlendWeight</key>
        <string>Smoothstep t*t*(3-2*t) on control-point horizontal fitting across the below-baseline band. This removes the linear-weight endpoint change while keeping the actual SC stem target and translated deep native hook. Actual rounded curve tangents and optical junctions still require inspection.</string>
